 "captions": [
  {
   "from": 0.3,
   "to": 2.2,
   "text": "What if zombies could only move..."
  },
  {
   "from": 2.64,
   "to": 3.41,
   "text": "...when you BLINK?"
  },
  {
   "from": 3.98,
   "to": 5.33,
   "text": "At first, it sounds easy."
  },
  {
   "from": 5.71,
   "to": 6.65,
   "text": "Just don't blink."
  },
  {
   "from": 7.4,
   "to": 11.16,
   "text": "But the average person blinks 15 to 20 times a minute."
  },
  {
   "from": 11.84,
   "to": 15.47,
   "text": "That's up to 1,200 chances an hour for them to get closer."
  },
  {
   "from": 16.2,
   "to": 17.61,
   "text": "Try to hold your eyes open,"
  },
  {
   "from": 17.96,
   "to": 19.62,
   "text": "and within a minute they burn,"
  },
  {
   "from": 19.92,
   "to": 20.64,
   "text": "they water,"
  },
  {
   "from": 21.03,
   "to": 22.32,
   "text": "and you can't see a thing."
  },
  {
   "from": 23.2,
   "to": 24.17,
   "text": "So you team up."
  },
  {
   "from": 24.65,
   "to": 26.87,
   "text": "One person watches while the other blinks."
  },
  {
   "from": 27.38,
   "to": 28.28,
   "text": "You take turns."
  },
  {
   "from": 28.78,
   "to": 29.48,
   "text": "And it works."
  },
  {
   "from": 29.98,
   "to": 30.69,
   "text": "Day one."
  },
  {
   "from": 31.27,
   "to": 31.97,
   "text": "Day two."
  },
  {
   "from": 32.45,
   "to": 33.39,
   "text": "Day three."
  },
  {
   "from": 34.4,
   "to": 36.19,
   "text": "But after a day or two without sleep,"
  },
  {
   "from": 36.64,
   "to": 38.59,
   "text": "your brain starts shutting off on its own."
  },
  {
   "from": 39.06,
   "to": 40.05,
   "text": "MICROSLEEPS."
  },
  {
   "from": 40.43,
   "to": 41.75,
   "text": "A few seconds at a time."
  },
  {
   "from": 42.03,
   "to": 43.01,
   "text": "You don't even notice."
  },
  {
   "from": 43.52,
   "to": 45.08,
   "text": "And every time your eyes close..."
  },
  {
   "from": 45.73,
   "to": 46.37,
   "text": "they MOVE."
  },
  {
   "from": 46.94,
   "to": 49.41,
   "text": "Sooner or later, everyone has to sleep."
  },
  {
   "from": 49.91,
   "to": 50.37,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "from": 50.79,
   "to": 51.73,
   "text": "who's watching YOU?"
  },
  {
   "from": 52.44,
   "to": 54.44,
   "text": "Comment how you'd survive the first night."
  }
 ],
